@title Cabinet heat: Simulate heat of the cabinet
@area Heat
# Cabinet workspace, run the coarse simulation from the command field, look at hot-spot cards and the Temperature panel.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate heat of the cabinet
wait 4
key Enter
wait 60
shot heat-running
# Waits count frames but the solver runs on the wall clock, so wait real seconds. At 1366 the Heat toggle sits in More: the run must still report (it showed "starting" for good).
wait_s 60
expect "it "
shot heat-result
check_blank heat-result
check_layout
